{
  "name": "wind_pump_well",
  "version": 1,
  "introduced_by": "kitehold",
  "notes": "A well and wind pump 7 x 6.5 m on the ground, 10.5 m high overall: a stone well-head 3 m in diameter, a braced timber tower over it with its head at 8 m, carrying a 2.5 m 16-bladed wheel on the -Z side and a saffron tail vane to +Z, a pump rod down the bore and a spout into a 2 x 1.25 m trough on the +X side. The wheel is still; it carves nothing.",
